<div id="top"></div>

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="title">
  <div class="wrap hero__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Content design case study · Public service form</p>
      <h1 id="title">From a 2-page paper form to a service people can <span class="hl">finish in one go</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">I redesigned a council's single person discount form using GOV.UK patterns. I cut the questions the council didn't need, put eligibility first, and wrote an error message for everything that can go wrong.</p>
      <ul class="chips" aria-label="Skills shown">
        <li>Question protocol</li><li>One thing per page</li><li>Error messages</li><li>GOV.UK Design System</li><li>Accessibility</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button" href="/council-form/prototype/">Try the prototype</a>
        <a class="button button--ghost" href="#problem">Read the case study</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="phone-fig" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="phone" inert><iframe src="/council-form/prototype/others-18/?preview=1" title="Prototype: the first question, does anyone else aged 18 or over live with you" loading="lazy"></iframe></div>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--tight" aria-label="Project summary">
  <div class="wrap">
    <dl class="meta">
      <div><dt>My role</dt><dd>Content designer, self-initiated</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Original</dt><dd>Hertsmere Borough Council PDF form</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Made</dt><dd>Question protocol, flow, error messages, prototype</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Standards</dt><dd>GOV.UK Design System, WCAG 2.2 AA</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--brand" aria-labelledby="results-strip">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="results-strip" class="visually-hidden">Results at a glance</h2>
    <ul class="stats">
      <li class="stat"><span class="stat__value">22 → 8</span><span class="stat__label">blanks on paper, down to 8 short questions for someone who has always lived alone</span></li>
      <li class="stat"><span class="stat__value">4</span><span class="stat__label">questions cut after the question protocol</span></li>
      <li class="stat"><span class="stat__value">23</span><span class="stat__label">specific error messages, instead of none</span></li>
      <li class="stat"><span class="stat__value">0</span><span class="stat__label">accessibility issues found by axe, on every page</span></li>
